Package: ntriples
Title: N-Triples Serialization and RDF Utility Functions
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Daniel", family = "Antal", 
           email = "daniel.antal@dataobservatory.eu", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7513-6760")
           )) 
Description: Provides lightweight, dependency-minimal tools for
    serializing RDF N-Triples in R. Supports IRI validation,
    typed RDF literals, date-time serialization, and provenance
    statements for utils::person objects using PROV-O or FOAF.
    Designed for reuse by packages implementing higher-level
    RDF data models and provenance workflows.
